{"id":"m4-161","m":4,"paper":"2019年420联考《行测》题（吉林乙级）（网友回忆版）","region":"吉林","year":2019,"q":7,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"2376442","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"11，24，26，（    ），19","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"24"},{"k":"B","t":"25"},{"k":"C","t":"26"},{"k":"D","t":"39"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>观察数列，变化不一致，作差行不通，考虑机械拆分，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-72302a6a3b512185.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f514649c88c1d769.png\" />、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-097ad9e3c850f6e2.png\" />、（  ）、<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6d6bec572b4427be.png\" />；得到新数列0、2、4、（  ）、8，构成公差为2的等差数列，那么<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3062c39444d606a2.png\" />。即所求项的个位数字减去十位数字为6，观察选项，只有D项<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-d47a91a99e68df2d.png\" />满足。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"2376443","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"2，8，26，（    ），242","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"60"},{"k":"B","t":"80"},{"k":"C","t":"120"},{"k":"D","t":"180"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：观察数列特性，在幂次数字附近，考虑幂次修正数列。原数列可以转化为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5db9aad2a5b97604.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5bb02dd427bab5b5.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-837af5fe864769cf.png\" />，（  ），<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-eff09520043f2b26.png\" />。可以看出所求项<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2bf3799b19047696.png\" />。</p><p>方法二：观察数列没有看出特征，优先考虑作差，作差后得到新数列：6、18、（  ），（  ），作差后相邻两项之间是3倍关系，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f0ed371715dc1bd8.png\" />，则新数列第一个<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-bf7a374b0bfbe38a.png\" />，代入原数列，原数列<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4e55d1e6679e797a.png\" />，对应B选项，验证规律，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-cbb9d552b1094aa3.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-5d86ebd5ccf1b2bc.png\" />，符合题意。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"2376543","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某宣讲团甲宣传员骑摩托车从红星村出发以20公里/小时的速度去相距60公里的八一村，1小时后由于路面湿滑，速度减少一半，在甲出发1小时后，乙宣传员以50公里/小时的速度开车从红星村出发追甲，当乙追上甲时，他们与八一村的距离为","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"​25公里"},{"k":"B","t":"​30公里"},{"k":"C","t":"​35公里"},{"k":"D","t":"​40公里"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题意可知，甲出发一小时后的路程为20公里。之后甲速度变为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3ad215cd19ef016f.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3915ca42d6f39fe6.png\" />公里/小时，根据追及公式“<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-85974d803e574bda.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-cfe4e6fa1b8d1ca8.png\" />”，可得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-99ee5dc4b218f257.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-25f0caa22e1d6a6f.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ec13c3d090f7f0b5.png\" />小时。此时，乙的路程为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-21a0d1d86777299c.png\" />公里，距离八一村还有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f0e3a1ac6d5b8b15.png\" />公里。</p><p>故正确答案为C。</p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"2376545","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"汽车厂甲、乙、丙三个机器人承担拧螺丝任务，程序设定甲先开始，3分钟后乙开始，再3分钟后丙开始。当乙工作12分钟时，所拧的螺丝数与甲拧的螺丝数相同，丙工作20分钟时，所拧的螺丝数与甲拧的螺丝数相同，则丙的工作效率是乙的","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"1.04倍"},{"k":"B","t":"1倍"},{"k":"C","t":"0.9倍"},{"k":"D","t":"0.8倍"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>根据题意可知，甲开始3分钟后乙再开始，则乙工作12分钟时，甲已工作了15分钟。<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-654230c7def8ebc4.png\" />，总量相同时，效率与时间成反比，甲乙工作时间之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-63146166fbb42e05.png\" />，则效率之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f364ad01d6086e01.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1f693aa24e7741e4.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e828f31110eeefe1.png\" />。</p><p>同理，乙开始3分钟后丙再开始，即甲开始6分钟后丙再开始，则丙工作20分钟时，甲已工作了26分钟。甲丙的效率之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-dc220652ab2c884a.png\" />。甲乙丙三个机器人效率之比为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-3920e8c540ae69a3.png\" />，则丙的工作效率是乙的<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0e4713b06313d17f.png\" />倍。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"2376547","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>将浓度分别为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0d88db9a8e9ae5b5.png\" />和<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9cf2b96c0c5f472e.png\" />的酒精溶液各100毫升混合在一个容器里，要想使混合后酒精溶液的浓度达到<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-062fc2c7076e6398.png\" />，需要加水</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"40毫升"},{"k":"B","t":"50毫升"},{"k":"C","t":"60毫升"},{"k":"D","t":"70毫升"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：设加水<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-df39880a7c135d23.png\" />毫升，根据混合前后溶质的量不变可列方程：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-687011abd24b8369.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f9ddf298c24afecd.png\" />，解得<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-60f5dce6688f8420.png\" />毫升。</p><p>方法二：根据线段法可知，距离与量成反比。第一次混合时，两种溶液质量相等，可知混合之后的浓度应为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a9248fbec97d7f2c.png\" />。第二次与水混合后浓度变为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-062fc2c7076e6398.png\" />，则<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-422e0d2608bb1e3b.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-578281afee69611e.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-86ade77dbd4ce8ab.png\" />，可知需加水40毫升。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":6,"qid":"2376549","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"小明有2盆兰花和3盆杜鹃，小明打算随机拿出2盆送给小红，则至少有1盆兰花的概率是","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9e1293eb5b12ebb7.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2dbaa7c2c757c4dd.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2bc5fd66ed945d47.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c7ab924a8c7bcd62.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>方法一：从5盆中任选两盆，有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9a5c2619550f28cf.png\" />种方法。至少有1盆兰花包括两种情况：①有1盆兰花，情况数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0c56cff5f377e4e3.png\" />；②2盆都是兰花，情况数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-92e451d6e7af1ddf.png\" />种；共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2141019773173e9b.png\" />种。则至少有一盆为兰花的概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c7ab924a8c7bcd62.png\" />。</p><p>方法二：正面情况较多可以从反面考虑，至少有1盆兰花的反面为没有兰花，即2盆都是杜鹃，情况数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0de3a3aef827ed82.png\" />种，总情况数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-9a5c2619550f28cf.png\" />种，所求的概率为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-84eed939eda4f4c0.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"},{"n":7,"qid":"2376551","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"<p>某计算机企业有职工150人，其中50岁以上共有50人。现拟减员增效，总体规模压缩为100人，并规定50岁以上的人裁减比例为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-6df5552bc0be517b.png\" />，则50岁以下的人裁减比例为</p>","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-200186aa106b40fd.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"B","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-447002bd7eb98d98.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"C","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-fbcd04d8ef29962c.png\" /></p>"},{"k":"D","t":"<p><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ee08713ca74cb24b.png\" /></p>"}],"ans":["D"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>需裁减的总人数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c5f7ba902aff54a2.png\" />人，50岁以上需裁减人数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c5c4483dea5274b3.png\" />人。50岁以下原来有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-0a32009b7dad6b68.png\" />人，需要裁减人数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-70821465398dc6ff.png\" />人，裁减比例为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2770c9baad152134.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为D。</p>"}]}]}